<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2025/10/apple-tv-rebrand-icon.jpg" alt="" width="160" height="90" class="brief" align="left" style="float:left;margin:0 20px 20px 0;width:160px;height:auto;" />Apple on Monday will add a video podcasts section to the Apple TV app, bringing it to more than 1 billion devices that have the app, reports <em><a href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/16/business/media/apple-tv-podcasts-youtube.html">The New York Times</a></em>. The new video podcasts section will initially be just for developer testing. <br/>
<br/>
